  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "According to BODMAS rule\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2042326d26ec7b593e52bbbdd22d890b59b1e59f92be81a7235509e9af1c4625.png] \n\nGiven equation 88 * 120 * 42 * 240 * 48 * 2\n\n**Option 1 :** Using the combination =, ×, +, ÷, –\n\n88 = 120 × 42 + ***__240 __******__÷ 48__*** – 2\n\n**By BODMAS rule**\n\n88 = ***__120 __******__× 42__*** + 5 – 2\n\n88 = ***__5040 + 5__*** – 2\n\n88 = ***__5045 - 2__***\n\n88 ≠ 5043** (LHS **≠** RHS)**\n\n**Option 2 : Using combination **×, ÷, =, –, +\n\n88 × ***__120 __******__÷ 42__*** = 240 - 48 + 2\n\n88 × ***__2.85__*** = 240 - 48 + 2\n\n251.42 = ***__240__*** – 48 ***__+ 2__***\n\n251.42 = 242 – 48\n\n251.42 ≠ 194** (LHS **≠** RHS)**\n\n**Option 3 :** Using the combination +, ÷, –, =, ×\n\n88 + ***__120 __******__÷ 42__*** - 240 = 48 × 2\n\n88 + 2.85 - 240 = ***__48 __******__× 2__***\n\n***__88 + 2.85__*** - 240 = 96\n\n90.85 – 240 = 96\n\n- 149.15 ≠ 96 **(LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n**Option 4 :** Using the combination =, –, +, ÷, ×\n\n88 = 120 - 42 + ***__240 __******__÷ 48__*** × 2\n\n88 = 120 - 42 + ***__5 __******__× 2__***\n\n88 = ***__120__*** - 42 ***__+ 10__***\n\n88 = 130 - 42\n\n88 = 88 **(LHS = RHS)**\n\nHence, the answer is** Option 4: “****=, –, +, ÷, ×****”.**",
